    <briefdescription>
<para>A soft halo around the lines and markers of a series. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The halo fades out over <computeroutput>radius</computeroutput> pixels outside the drawn shape. It is drawn in the same pass as the series, with no offscreen blur. A fading item and its halo fade together. Halos of parts of a line that come close to each other add up, as halos of separate lines do.</para>
<para><table rows="5" cols="2"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Series  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Glows around  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>The line and its markers  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>The markers  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1BarSeries" kindref="compound">BarSeries</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>The bars  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1ErrorBarSeries" kindref="compound">ErrorBarSeries</ref></computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>The error bars  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SeriesEffect" kindref="compound">SeriesEffect</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1FadeTrail" kindref="compound">FadeTrail</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
